1
00:00:03,227 --> 00:00:07,180
Pick your presence from the menu at the top of the soft phone.

2
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:10,667
My workspace has the same menu in its presence button.

3
00:00:11,135 --> 00:00:13,564
Available means you can receive work.

4
00:00:13,564 --> 00:00:18,026
A reason code, such as Team meeting, makes you not ready and records why.

5
00:00:18,026 --> 00:00:21,075
Break reasons are grouped under a Break heading.

6
00:00:21,563 --> 00:00:23,602
Offline stops all work.

7
00:00:23,602 --> 00:00:26,413
It is in the soft phone menu only.

